    "header": "",
    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><strong>·假说辑录</strong></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\" id=\"2e9ec43cad1c0981a055765bb560ff4b\" alt=\"4-2battlepass.png\" title=\"4-2battlepass.png\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/_staging/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20240611/2e9ec43cad1c0981a055765bb560ff4b.png\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">通过获取</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">魂灵书签</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">提升</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">等级，即可领取对应等级的奖励。</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的每一级都有奖励，达到对应等级即可领取。</span><br/><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">在主题持续更新的数月内，每月初会增加</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">的等级上限，奖励也会持续增加。</span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">更新结束后，</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">等级上限将不再提升。总奖励会常驻存在，当前等级进度会保留，若未达到等级上限可继续获取</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">魂灵书签</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">进行等级提升。当</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">假说辑录</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">等级达到当前最高等级后，您将无法再继续获得</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">魂灵书签</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span><br/><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">您可以通过以下几种方式获取</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">魂灵书签</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">：</span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">每次常规行动探险结束时，本次探险得分将按比例换算为</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">魂灵书签</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">解锁</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">巫仪档案库<strong> - </strong>想象实体图鉴</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的未知收藏品。</span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">解锁</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">巫仪档案库<strong> - </strong>佚散思维辑录</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的未知思绪。</span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">本月委托栏</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">中的限时委托（仅限主题更新期间）。</span><br/><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">完成</span><span style=\"color:#be5d52\">每月委托</span><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">获得一次性报酬（仅限主题更新期间）。</span></p>",
    "displayTime": "2024-07-16",
